@startuml ppo_algorithm_phases_enhanced
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 9

skinparam component {
  BackgroundColor #F8F8F8
  BorderColor #333333
  BorderThickness 2
}

component [**Phase 1: Experience Collection**\nSample trajectories $\tau \sim \pi_\theta$\nStore $(s_t, a_t, r_t, s_{t+1})$\nCollect $T$ episodes] as Phase1 #E6F3FF

component [**Phase 2: Advantage Estimation**\nCompute $\hat{A}_t = \sum_{l=0}^{\infty} (\gamma\lambda)^l \delta_{t+l}$\nCalculate $R_t^{(\mathrm{total})} = \sum_{k=0}^{\infty} \gamma^k r_{t+k}$\nGAE: $\lambda = 0.95, \gamma = 0.99$] as Phase2 #E6FFE6

component [**Phase 3: Policy Update**\nMinibatch SGD on $\mathcal{L}^{CLIP}$\n$K$ epochs per update\nPPO clipped objective] as Phase3 #FFE6E6

Phase1 --> Phase2 : Trajectory Data
Phase2 --> Phase3 : Advantages & Returns
Phase3 --> Phase1 : Updated Policy $\pi_\theta$

note bottom of Phase3 : $\mathcal{L}^{CLIP}(\theta) = \mathbb{E}[ \min(r_t(\theta)\hat{A}_t, \mathrm{clip}(r_t(\theta), 1-\epsilon, 1+\epsilon)\hat{A}_t) ]$\n$\delta_t = r_t + \gamma V_\phi(s_{t+1}) - V_\phi(s_t)$\n$\epsilon = 0.2, c_1 = 0.01, c_2 = 0.5$

@enduml
